      "defect": "SageMaker endpoint operates without data quality monitoring.\n",
      "infection": "When input data distribution shifts (naturally or through poisoning), the model's predictions degrade silently. Without a monitor comparing live data against a baseline, there is no signal that the model is operating outside its training distribution — the model continues serving degraded or adversarially influenced predictions.\n",
